## 1. The Nature of the Choice

The global system stands at a precipice. On one side lies the path of fiduciary obligation—the recognition that authority is a trust, a duty to serve the public. On the other side lies the path of accelerating collapse—the continuation of a system that extracts, dominates, and destroys.

